===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|busines}}, {{m|enm|busynes}}, {{m|enm|businesse}}, {{m|enm|bisynes}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bisiġnes|t=business, busyness}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|busy|ness}}. {{doublet|en|busyness}}.

